{"unit_id":"tag:0DW0:proof","translation":"由假设 (2) 及该命题，<MATH_0001> 有足够点（has enough points）。<MATH_0002> 的点（points）给出 <MATH_0003> 的点（points），通过引理 <REF_0001> 的过程得到。因此只须证明：若 <MATH_0004> 是 <MATH_0005> 上层（sheaves）的映射（map），使得 <MATH_0006> 对所有 <MATH_0007> 都是同构（isomorphism），则 <MATH_0008> 是同构（isomorphism）。由假设 (1)，对每个对象（object）<MATH_0009>（属于 <MATH_0010>），有覆盖（covering）<MATH_0011>，使得对 <MATH_0012>，存在 <MATH_0013> 和态射（morphism）<MATH_0014>。于是映射（maps）<MATH_0015> 是双射的（bijective），而 <MATH_0016> 也类似。层条件（sheaf condition）表明 <MATH_0017> 是双射的（bijective），如所要求的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"has enough points","target_term":"有足够点"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"bijective","target_term":"双射的"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"},{"source_term":"bijective","target_term":"双射的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"has enough points","target_term":"有足够点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"bijective","target_term":"双射的","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
